@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/tutorial-pawn-gas-collision.puml
' purpose: defensive evacuation — block c3, unsiege d2, leave
' status: ACTIVE — focused drill; product = StarChess
' covers: apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/demos/choreography/usePawnGasDefenseCounter.ts
' live spec: _spec/packages/starchess-core/mine-contact.puml
'            _spec/apps/starchess/architecture/storybook-projection.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' Seed: White K d1, R d2 sieged (S:d2), P c2; Black
' B b4, K h8. Both gas grant a single step, never
' a double. Enemy B b4→d2 is choreographed once.
title Defensive gas — hold d1;\nblock c3, unsiege d2 to e2

component "lesson config\nCC d1 · R d2 · P c2" as CFG <<app>>
component "pawnGasDefenseCounter\nB b4→d2 once" as CHOREO <<app>>
component "TutorialScreen\nlive engine + gates" as RUN <<app>>
component "**tank or CC lost**\nR/K missing" as LOSE <<error>>

CFG ARROW_MAIN RUN
CHOREO ARROW_QUEUE RUN : B b4→d2
LOSE ARROW_ERROR RUN : restartWhen R/K gone

note bottom of RUN
  **Keep CC d1 alive; evacuate d2 to e2.**
  Gas pawn c2→c3, gas unsiege d2, then
  move R d2→e2. Both gas are single
  steps. Hints narrow: c3, then e2.
end note

note bottom of CHOREO
  **Enemy queues B b4→d2 once on T1.**
  Deterministic per turn; lesson only.
  Generic adjutant stays untouched.
  Seed Q stays empty for this hook.
end note

legend bottom
  **Implement this file.**
  ==
  Diff ""tutorialScript.config.ts"".
  Win R off d2 + K d1; fail R/K gone,
  never S absence alone.
end legend
@enduml
